Modified since 2026-10-24: separate application identity, multi-device
proximity policy, DPAPI-encrypted secret storage, peer-verified credential
IPC, one-time paired-device binding, an optional input-gated return unlock, and a
Tauri desktop interface. Every source file in this repository may contain such
modifications.

The IRK verification code follows the algorithm used by watch-unlock-linux.
